INSERT INTO `product_faqs` VALUES (1,20,'How is PCOD different from PCOS?','PCOD and PCOS are both hormonal disorders that can affect fertility. In PCOD, ovaries release immature eggs due to hormonal imbalance, whereas PCOS involves a more severe hormonal disturbance with cyst formation and metabolic impacts.',1,'2025-12-01 07:52:45','2025-12-01 07:52:45'),(2,21,'What is vitality?','Vitality refers to a person\'s ability to live actively with energy, growth, and development. It is associated with feeling strong, energetic, and vigorous.',1,'2025-12-01 07:54:41','2025-12-01 07:54:41'),(3,22,'I am looking for hair growth as my hair is thin and frizzy. Can I use this?','Yes, you can use RasayanaBio Rosemary Hair Serum as it is 100% pure and natural. It is formulated with the goodness of Bhringraj, Amla, Rosemary, Arnica, Fenugreek, and Ginseng that nourish the scalp and encourage healthy hair growth.',1,'2025-12-01 07:56:09','2025-12-01 07:56:09'),(4,26,'What is A1C level?','A1C is a blood test that measures your average blood glucose levels over the past 2–3 months. It is used to diagnose and monitor diabetes. Normal: Below 5.7%, Prediabetes: 5.7%–6.4%, Diabetes: 6.5% or above.',1,'2025-12-01 07:58:46','2025-12-01 07:58:46'),(5,29,'Is Milk Thistle also good for cholesterol?','Yes, milk thistle (especially its active compound silymarin) may help manage cholesterol levels by lowering total and LDL (“bad”) cholesterol while supporting HDL (“good”) cholesterol levels.',1,'2025-12-01 08:01:03','2025-12-01 08:01:03'),(6,33,'Is this supplement suitable for everyone?','It is suitable for most adults. However, individuals with medical conditions, pregnant or lactating women, or those with food allergies should consult a healthcare provider before use.',1,'2025-12-01 08:04:56','2025-12-01 08:04:56'),(7,24,'Does it help in detoxification?','Yes, it contains green tea which is rich in plant compounds and antioxidants that help reduce toxin accumulation in the body.',1,'2025-12-01 08:06:30','2025-12-01 08:06:30'),(8,30,'What is vitality?','Vitality is the ability to live actively with energy, growth, and development. It refers to feeling strong, energetic, and active.',1,'2025-12-01 08:07:40','2025-12-01 08:07:40'),(9,28,'Who should consume this product?','If you have low stamina, feel lethargic, are experiencing hormonal concerns, or have low libido, you can start using this product.',1,'2025-12-01 08:08:58','2025-12-01 08:08:58'),(10,34,'What are the benefits of Ashwagandha?','Ashwagandha has been shown to have many potential benefits, including reducing stress and anxiety, improving brain function, reducing inflammation, lowering cholesterol and triglycerides, and boosting testosterone and fertility in men.',1,'2025-12-01 08:13:13','2025-12-01 08:13:13'),(11,23,'Who should consume this product?','If your stamina is poor, feel lethargic most of the time, dealing with hormonal issues or have low libido then you should start consuming this product.',1,'2025-12-01 08:16:22','2025-12-01 08:16:22'),(12,25,'How does marine collagen work?','Collagen is the most abundant protein in the human body and makes up over 70% of the dermis, the middle layer of skin. As we age, collagen levels tend to decline, which can lead to sagging skin and the appearance of wrinkles. Nutra\'s Bounty Marine Collagen stimulates collagen production to counter the effects of age-related collagen loss.',1,'2025-12-01 08:17:38','2025-12-01 08:17:38'),(13,31,'How PCOD is differ from PCOS?','PCOD and PCOS are both hormonal disorders that can cause infertility. However, there are some difference in both conditions like in PCOD the ovaries start releasing immature eggs that lead to hormonal.',1,'2025-12-01 08:19:49','2025-12-01 08:19:49'),(16,20,'What happens after taking Nutra’s Bounty PCOS/PCOD care capsules?','They absorb into the digestive system to help reduce high insulin levels and androgen production. This may help minimize symptoms like acne, unwanted hair growth, and metabolic issues related to PCOS.',2,'2025-12-01 07:52:45','2025-12-01 07:52:45'),(17,21,'How long should I use the Nutra’s Bounty Male Vitality capsules to see results?','Use consistently for at least 2 months to notice benefits such as improved stamina, libido, and enhanced blood flow.',2,'2025-12-01 07:54:41','2025-12-01 07:54:41'),(18,22,'How often can I use this?','We recommend using RasayanaBio Rosemary Hair Serum 2–3 times a week for best results.',2,'2025-12-01 07:56:09','2025-12-01 07:56:09'),(19,26,'How does the human body maintain blood sugar levels?','Blood sugar levels are controlled mainly by the pancreas and liver. Insulin lowers blood sugar by helping glucose enter cells for energy, while glucagon increases blood sugar by signaling the liver to release stored glucose.',2,'2025-12-01 07:58:46','2025-12-01 07:58:46'),(20,29,'What is fatty liver?','Fatty liver disease (hepatic steatosis) occurs when excess fat builds up in the liver. It can be of two types: Nonalcoholic Fatty Liver Disease (NAFLD) — associated with obesity, type 2 diabetes, high cholesterol, and metabolic syndrome; and Alcoholic Fatty Liver Disease (AFLD) — caused by excessive alcohol consumption.',2,'2025-12-01 08:01:03','2025-12-01 08:01:03'),(21,33,'Does Nutra’s Bounty Sleep Support help with anxiety & stress?','Yes. Ingredients like Valerian Root and Chamomile help increase GABA levels in the brain, promoting relaxation and reducing anxiety.',2,'2025-12-01 08:04:56','2025-12-01 08:04:56'),(22,24,'Can I take these capsules alongside my regular diet?','Yes, these capsules can be taken with your regular diet. For best results, maintain a balanced diet rich in fruits, vegetables, and whole grains.',2,'2025-12-01 08:06:30','2025-12-01 08:06:30'),(23,30,'How long should I use the Nutra’s Bounty Male Vitality capsules to see results?','It is recommended to use the capsules consistently for at least 2 months for benefits such as improved stamina, libido, and blood flow.',2,'2025-12-01 08:07:40','2025-12-01 08:07:40'),(24,28,'Can I take Nutra’s Bounty Female Vitality if I have a pre-existing medical condition?','It is recommended to consult your healthcare provider before using this product if you have any underlying health conditions.',2,'2025-12-01 08:08:58','2025-12-01 08:08:58'),(25,34,'Is this product safe for children?','No, this product is not safe for children as it is only suitable for adult bodies. Hence, it is not recommended for children.',2,'2025-12-01 08:13:13','2025-12-01 08:13:13'),(26,23,'Can I take Nutra’s Bounty female vitality if I have a pre-existing medical condition?','It’s best to consult your healthcare provider before using the product if you have any underlying medical conditions.',2,'2025-12-01 08:16:22','2025-12-01 08:16:22'),(27,25,'How long does it take to see real results?','Studies show that you can notice visible results as early as four to six weeks after getting started on your collagen food supplements. With consistent use of Collagen , you’ll notice a change in the quality of your skin, nails, and hair!',2,'2025-12-01 08:17:38','2025-12-01 08:17:38'),(28,31,'Is this a cure for PCOS?','While it is an effective formula for management of PCOS. Myo-Inositol manages symptoms triggered by hormonal imbalance and doesn\'t cure PCOS. There is no medical cure for PCOS, but it can be managed with medication, healthy diet, and regular exercise.',2,'2025-12-01 08:19:49','2025-12-01 08:19:49'),(31,20,'Is this a cure for PCOS?','It effectively helps in managing PCOS symptoms caused by hormonal imbalance, but it does not cure PCOS. There is no permanent cure; symptoms can be managed with medication, healthy diet, and regular exercise.',3,'2025-12-01 07:52:45','2025-12-01 07:52:45'),(32,21,'Can I take the Nutra’s Bounty Male Vitality capsules with other medications?','They are natural and generally safe, but it is advised to consult your healthcare provider to avoid possible interactions with other medications.',3,'2025-12-01 07:54:41','2025-12-01 07:54:41'),(33,22,'What is the main advantage of this product?','The serum is crafted with natural ingredients powered by hair growth–boosting bioactives that work together to promote luscious hair and a healthy scalp.',3,'2025-12-01 07:56:09','2025-12-01 07:56:09'),(34,26,'Do I need to follow any special diet while using this product?','Maintain a healthy diet, exercise regularly, avoid fried and processed foods, and manage weight for best results.',3,'2025-12-01 07:58:46','2025-12-01 07:58:46'),(35,29,'Are liver supplements safe to take?','Liver supplements are generally considered safe when taken as directed. However, individuals with liver issues, allergies, or who are on medications should consult their healthcare professional before use.',3,'2025-12-01 08:01:03','2025-12-01 08:01:03'),(36,33,'Who should avoid Nutra’s Bounty Sleep Support?','People with pre-existing medical conditions should consult a doctor before use. This product is not intended to cure, diagnose, or prevent any disease.',3,'2025-12-01 08:04:56','2025-12-01 08:04:56'),(37,24,'What happens if I stop using Nutra’s Bounty weight loss capsule after achieving my desired weight?','To maintain weight loss, continue a healthy lifestyle with balanced eating and regular exercise. Stopping the supplement alone won’t directly cause weight gain, lifestyle habits are key.',3,'2025-12-01 08:06:30','2025-12-01 08:06:30'),(38,30,'Can I take the Nutra’s Bounty Male Vitality capsules with other medications?','These capsules are natural and generally safe, but consulting a healthcare provider is advised if you are taking other medications.',3,'2025-12-01 08:07:40','2025-12-01 08:07:40'),(39,28,'How long does it take to notice results?','Most women observe improved energy and libido within 30 days, with full benefits seen after 3 months of consistent use.',3,'2025-12-01 08:08:58','2025-12-01 08:08:58'),(40,34,'Are there any side effects of Ashwagandha?','Ashwagandha is generally considered safe for most people when taken in recommended doses. However, some people may experience side effects such as upset stomach, diarrhea, and vomiting. It may also interact with certain medications, so it is important to consult with a healthcare professional before taking Ashwagandha if you are on any medication.',3,'2025-12-01 08:13:13','2025-12-01 08:13:13'),(41,23,'How long does it take to notice results?','Most women report noticeable improvements in energy and desire within 30 days, with full effects after 3 months of consistent use.',3,'2025-12-01 08:16:22','2025-12-01 08:16:22'),(42,25,'What is the best age to take collagen supplements?','Collagen is helpful for people in their mid-20s and above, since that’s when collagen production begins to slow down for both men and women. It have been shown to improve skin health parameters on Indian skin, suggesting that collagen peptides supplements are beneficial for skin health and appearance.',3,'2025-12-01 08:17:38','2025-12-01 08:17:38'),(46,21,'How does this product benefit men?','Nutra’s Bounty Male Vitality capsules act as a herbal energizer that helps boost stamina and energy levels. They also help reduce stress, contributing to overall physical performance.',4,'2025-12-01 07:54:41','2025-12-01 07:54:41'),(47,22,'Can this product be used by both men & women?','Absolutely, this hair serum is safe for use by both men and women.',4,'2025-12-01 07:56:09','2025-12-01 07:56:09'),(48,26,'How long will it take to show results?','Results may vary from person to person. However, visible improvements in symptoms may be noticed within one month of regular use.',4,'2025-12-01 07:58:46','2025-12-01 07:58:46'),(49,29,'For how long do I need to use this product?','Results vary based on health condition and lifestyle. Some may notice improvements within a few weeks, while others may need consistent use over several months for optimal benefits.',4,'2025-12-01 08:01:03','2025-12-01 08:01:03'),(50,33,'Can Nutra’s Bounty Sleep Support be taken with other medications?','Consult a healthcare professional before combining it with other medications to avoid potential interactions.',4,'2025-12-01 08:04:56','2025-12-01 08:04:56'),(51,24,'Can I use it while breastfeeding or pregnant?','It is not recommended to use this product during pregnancy or breastfeeding. Always consult a healthcare provider before starting any supplement in such conditions.',4,'2025-12-01 08:06:30','2025-12-01 08:06:30'),(52,30,'How does this product benefit men?','Nutra’s Bounty Male Vitality capsules act as a herbal energizer that boosts energy and stamina in men. They also help reduce stress and support better performance.',4,'2025-12-01 08:07:40','2025-12-01 08:07:40'),(53,28,'Can Nutra’s Bounty Female Vitality help with hormonal imbalances?','Yes, it contains natural adaptogens like Ashwagandha, Maca Root, and Shatavari which help reduce stress, support hormonal balance, and improve reproductive wellness.',4,'2025-12-01 08:08:58','2025-12-01 08:08:58'),(54,34,'Is Ashwagandha safe during pregnancy and breastfeeding?','There is not enough research to determine whether Ashwagandha is safe during pregnancy and breastfeeding. It is recommended to avoid taking Ashwagandha during these times unless under the supervision of a healthcare professional.',4,'2025-12-01 08:13:13','2025-12-01 08:13:13'),(55,23,'What happens after taking Nutra’s Bounty PCOS/PCOD care capsules?','It absorbs into the digestive system to target higher insulin levels and androgen production in the body. It decreases PCOS symptoms like acne, body hair growth, fat cell biomarkers, and metabolic syndrome.',4,'2025-12-01 08:16:22','2025-12-01 08:16:22'),(56,25,'What’s the best time to consume RasayanaBio’s collagen?','The important thing is to consume it daily, so it’s best to choose any convenient time. Also, having your daily dose before/after a meal helps its nutrients get absorbed. If possible, try having it closer to the end of the day, since its collagen peptides aid our skin’s renewal process, which takes place when we sleep.',4,'2025-12-01 08:17:38','2025-12-01 08:17:38'),(61,26,'Can this supplement be taken with other medications?','It is generally safe, but consult your healthcare provider before combining with other medications, especially if you are being treated for diabetes or other conditions.',5,'2025-12-01 07:58:46','2025-12-01 07:58:46'),(62,33,'What are the benefits of Ashwagandha?','Ashwagandha may help reduce stress and anxiety, improve brain function, decrease inflammation, lower cholesterol levels, and support testosterone and fertility in men.',5,'2025-12-01 08:04:56','2025-12-01 08:04:56'),(63,24,'Does it help with cholesterol?','Yes, Garcinia may help lower bad cholesterol (LDL) and increase good cholesterol (HDL), which is beneficial for individuals with high cholesterol due to excess weight.',5,'2025-12-01 08:06:30','2025-12-01 08:06:30'),(64,34,'Who can consume?','Consult a doctor before use if you have a medical condition. Suitable for anyone looking to boost their performance, regulate the levels of stress and depression, athletes, fitness enthusiasts and more.',5,'2025-12-01 08:13:13','2025-12-01 08:13:13'),(65,23,'Can Nutra’s Bounty female vitality help with hormonal imbalances?','Yes, it contains natural adaptogens like Ashwagandha, maca root and shatavari, known to suppress stress and anxiety which directly support hormonal balance and improve overall reproductive health.',5,'2025-12-01 08:16:22','2025-12-01 08:16:22'),(66,25,'How PCOD is differ from PCOS?','PCOD and PCOS are both hormonal disorders that can cause infertility. However, there are some difference in both conditions like in PCOD the ovaries start releasing immature eggs that lead to hormonal.',5,'2025-12-01 08:17:38','2025-12-01 08:17:38'),(68,34,'What is vitality?','Vitality refers to a person’s ability to live, grow, and stay active. It reflects having energy, strength, and enthusiasm for daily life.',6,'2025-12-02 05:01:41','2025-12-02 05:01:41'),(69,34,'How long should I use the Nutra’s Bounty Male vitality capsules to see results?','For best results, use Nutra’s Bounty Male Vitality Capsules consistently for at least 2 months to support improved stamina, libido, and blood flow.',7,'2025-12-02 05:01:41','2025-12-02 05:01:41'),(70,34,'Can I take the Nutra’s Bounty Male vitality capsules with other medications?','Although the capsules are herbal and generally safe, it is recommended to consult a healthcare professional if taking other medications to avoid potential interactions.',8,'2025-12-02 05:01:41','2025-12-02 05:01:41'),(71,34,'How does this product benefit men?','Nutra’s Bounty Male Vitality Capsules help boost energy, stamina, testosterone levels, and reproductive well-being. They also help manage stress, improving overall performance and vitality.',9,'2025-12-02 05:01:41','2025-12-02 05:01:41'),(72,33,'Is this product safe for children?','No, this product is not safe for children as it is only suitable for adult bodies. Hence, it is not recommended for children.',6,'2025-12-02 05:04:45','2025-12-02 05:04:45'),(73,33,'Are there any side effects of Ashwagandha?','Ashwagandha is generally considered safe for most people when taken in recommended doses. However, some individuals may experience upset stomach, diarrhea, or vomiting. It may also interact with certain medications, so consult your healthcare professional if you are taking other medications.',7,'2025-12-02 05:04:45','2025-12-02 05:04:45'),(74,33,'Is Ashwagandha safe during pregnancy and breastfeeding?','There is not enough research to determine its safety during pregnancy or breastfeeding. It is recommended to avoid Ashwagandha during these periods unless advised by a healthcare professional.',8,'2025-12-02 05:04:45','2025-12-02 05:04:45'),(75,33,'Who can consume?','Consult a doctor before use if you have a medical condition. Suitable for individuals looking to enhance performance, manage stress, athletes, and fitness enthusiasts.',9,'2025-12-02 05:04:45','2025-12-02 05:04:45'),(76,23,'Is this a cure for PCOS?','While it is an effective formula for management of PCOS, Myo-Inositol helps manage symptoms triggered by hormonal imbalance but doesn\'t cure PCOS. There is currently no medical cure for PCOS, but it can be managed with medication, healthy diet, and regular exercise.',6,'2025-12-02 05:07:18','2025-12-02 05:07:18'),(77,23,'How PCOD is differ from PCOS?','PCOD and PCOS are both hormonal disorders that can cause infertility. However, in PCOD, the ovaries release immature eggs which leads to hormonal disturbances, while PCOS is a more severe metabolic condition involving hormonal imbalance and cyst formation.',7,'2025-12-02 05:07:18','2025-12-02 05:07:18');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `product_faqs` ENABLE KEYS */;
