INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (19,'Testing product','testing-product','this is a testing product','this is a testing product',8,'930ED141',500.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,0,0,'2025-11-19 08:15:53','2025-11-19 08:15:53','simple',250,'','#000000',1,5,1,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(20,'PCOS Care','pcos-care','Our PCOD/PCOS care is a specially crafted formula designed to support women managing Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS) and Polycystic Ovarian Disease (PCOD). Packed with powerful ingredients, this supplement aims to balance hormones, regulate menstrual cycles, and support overall reproductive health. The blend of herbs and nutrients, including Myo-Inositol, D-Chiro Inositol, Chromium, and Vitamin D, is scientifically backed to improve ovarian function, promote healthy insulin levels, and support fertility.','Nutra\'s Bounty PCOD/PCOS care is a specially crafted formula designed to support hormonal balance and alleviate the discomfort of Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS).',8,'5DB6538D',999.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,1,0,'2025-11-19 10:56:48','2025-11-28 06:26:36','simple',670,'','#F0EBEB',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Helps normalize irregular periods, reduce excessive androgen levels, and improve ovulation.\r\nSupports healthy weight management by improving metabolism and reducing insulin resistance.\r\nDiminishes acne breakouts and excessive hair growth associated with hormonal imbalances.\r\nCombats fatigue and improves overall energy levels.\r\nSupports better insulin function, helping to manage symptoms related to PCOS, such as weight gain and fatigue.\r\nEncourages regular ovulation, which can be helpful for women planning to conceive.',NULL,'Suggested Use: (Adults) A healthy Adult can take one tablet twice a day with water or as advised by the physician or as advised by a physician or a healthcare professional.','Vegan Friendly,\r\nScientifically Tested,\r\nNo Harsh Chemicals,\r\nNon GMO,\r\nGluten Free,\r\nVegetarian,\r\nSoy Free','A healthy Adult can take one tablet twice a day with water or as advised by a physician or a healthcare professional.','Keep out of reach of children. Do not take this or any other supplement if under the age of 18, pregnant or nursing a baby, or if you have any known or suspected medical conditions, and/or taking prescription drugs or over the counter medications.','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PCOD-1.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(21,'Multivitamin Gummies','multivitamin-gummies','Nutra’s Bounty Multivitamin Gummies provide a powerhouse blend of essential vitamins and minerals to help fill daily nutritional gaps. Formulated for overall wellness, these tasty mixed-fruit flavored gummies support immunity, energy production, bone strength, and healthier skin, hair & nails. Made for both adults and teens, they are easy to chew, gentle on the stomach, and suitable for everyday consumption. A convenient and enjoyable way to maintain an active and balanced lifestyle.','Nutra’s Bounty Multivitamin Gummies are delicious mixed-fruit flavored gummies designed to support overall health, immunity, and daily nutritional needs. Perfect for those who struggle to swallow tablets.',8,'0B84DB62',999.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,1,0,'2025-11-19 11:03:28','2025-11-28 06:28:20','simple',669.99,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Boosts Energy And Improves Mood\r\nPromotes Sexual Health and Reproductive Wellness\r\nRevitalizing Energy Source for Enduring Vitality\r\nDecreases Stress and Alleviates Anxiety',NULL,'Recommended Use: (Adults) A healthy adult can take one tablet twice a day with water, fifteen minutes before lunch and supper, as a supplement to oral hypoglycemics, or as directed by a healthcare provider.','Scientifically tested, \r\nNut- and gluten-free, \r\nNo harsh chemicals,\r\nNon-GMO,\r\nSoy-Free ','An adult in good health may take one tablet twice a day with water, fifteen minutes before lunch and supper, as a supplement to oral hypoglycemics, or as directed by a medical expert.','Keep out of children’s reach. If you are younger than eighteen, pregnant, breastfeeding, have any known or suspected medical issues, or are using prescription or over-the-counter medications, do not use this or any other supplement.\r\n\r\n*If you have any medical issues or are on medication, consult your doctor before using this product. Avoid using it if you are breastfeeding a baby or pregnant. Don’t take more than is advised each day. Not for use by anybody younger than eighteen. \r\n\r\nSTAY OUT OF CHILDREN’S REACH. \r\n\r\nAfter opening, store in a cool, dry location.','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/multivitamin-gummies_-min.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(22,'Hair Serum','hair-serum','Indulge your senses and nourish your hair with RasayanaBio Rosemary Hair Serum, a potent blend of nature\'s finest ingredients. This lightweight, non-greasy formula is designed to revitalize and strengthen your hair, leaving it soft, shiny, and full of life.','Indulge your senses and nourish your hair with RasayanaBio Rosemary Hair Serum, a potent blend of nature\'s finest ingredients. This lightweight, non-greasy formula is designed to revitalize and streng',6,'2504B571',1199.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,1,0,'2025-11-19 11:06:10','2025-11-27 11:12:31','simple',799,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Stimulates the scalp and encourages healthy hair growth.\r\nReduces breakage and split ends for stronger, more resilient hair.\r\nDeeply penetrates the hair shaft to hydrate and nourish.\r\nEnhances the natural shine and luster of your hair.\r\nCalms an irritated scalp and reduces dandruff.',NULL,'Dispense a small amount of serum into your palms. Massage the serum evenly through damp hair, focusing on the scalp and ends. Use regularly or as needed for best results.','Vegan Friendly,\r\nGluten Free,\r\nScientifically Tested,\r\nVegetarian,\r\nNo Harsh Chemicals,\r\nSoy Free,\r\nNON GMO',NULL,'People with sensitive skin are advised to perform a patch test. If a rash, redness, or itching appears, stop using it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(23,'Aphrodiasic for female','aphrodiasic-for-female','Female wellness begins with balance, and this natural supplement is designed to increase energy, enhance mood, and strengthen immunity. It contains a fantastic botanical mix that promotes energy and health, leaving you feeling strong, supple, and ready to face life','Female wellness begins with balance, and this natural supplement is designed to increase energy, enhance mood, and strengthen immunity. It contains a fantastic botanical mix that promotes energy and h',5,'0A519FB2',50.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,0,0,'2025-11-19 11:10:24','2025-11-27 11:59:40','simple',1,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Boosts Energy And Improves Mood\r\nPromotes Sexual Health and Reproductive Wellness\r\nRevitalizing Energy Source for Enduring Vitality\r\nDecreases Stress and Alleviates Anxiety',NULL,'Recommended Use: (Adults) A healthy adult can take one tablet twice a day with water, fifteen minutes before lunch and supper, as a supplement to oral hypoglycemics, or as directed by a healthcare provider.','Scientifically tested, \r\nNut- and gluten-free, \r\nNo harsh chemicals,\r\nNon-GMO,\r\nSoy-Free ','An adult in good health may take one tablet twice a day with water, fifteen minutes before lunch and supper, as a supplement to oral hypoglycemics, or as directed by a medical expert.','Keep out of children’s reach. If you are younger than eighteen, pregnant, breastfeeding, have any known or suspected medical issues, or are using prescription or over-the-counter medications, do not use this or any other supplement.\r\n\r\n*If you have any medical issues or are on medication, consult your doctor before using this product. Avoid using it if you are breastfeeding a baby or pregnant. Don’t take more than is advised each day. Not for use by anybody younger than eighteen. \r\n\r\nSTAY OUT OF CHILDREN’S REACH. \r\n\r\nAfter opening, store in a cool, dry location.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(24,'Bio Burner','bio-burner','Our Nutra’s Bounty Bio burner capsules is a carefully formulated blend of potent natural ingredients designed to support your weight loss goals in a healthy and sustainable way. Expertly designed using scientific evidence, these capsules are an effective and safe way to achieve your weight loss goals, remove extra fat from your body and promoting a healthier lifestyle.','Nutra\'s Bounty Bio burner is a blend of potent natural ingredients that will help accelerate your weight management goals.This herbal weight loss formulation is your best bet to get rid of the excess body fat and get in perfect shape.',9,'BBD189A5',999.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,0,0,'2025-11-19 11:16:35','2025-11-28 07:51:15','simple',720,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Accelerates your metabolism to burn calories more efficiently.\r\nHelps curb cravings and reduce overeating.\r\nSupports healthy digestion and nutrient absorption.\r\nTargets stubborn fat stores for effective weight loss.\r\nPromotes the breakdown of stored fat for energy.\r\nProvides sustained energy levels throughout the day',NULL,'Suggested Use: (Adults) A healthy Adult can take one or two capsules daily or as advised by a physician or a healthcare professional.','Vegan Friendly,\r\nScientifically Tested,\r\nNo Harsh Chemicals,\r\nNON GMO','A healthy Adult can take one two capsules daily or as advised by a physician or a healthcare professional.',NULL,'https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-min.jpg','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-min-1.jpg','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/3-min-1.jpg','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/4-min-1.jpg','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/5-min-1.jpg'),(25,'Collagen','collagen','Typically contain collagen peptides, which are smaller, broken-down pieces of collagen from animal sources like cows, pigs, or fish. These products are available in various forms, including powders, capsules, and gummies, and are marketed to improve skin hydration and elasticity, reduce wrinkles, support bone density, and aid joint health. ','Typically contain collagen peptides, which are smaller, broken-down pieces of collagen from animal sources like cows, pigs, or fish. These products are available in various forms, including powders, capsules, and gummies, and are marketed to improve skin hydration and elasticity, reduce wrinkles, support bone density, and aid joint health. ',5,'647626A6',599.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,0,0,'2025-11-19 11:21:50','2025-11-27 11:15:29','simple',499,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,'Suggested Use: (Adults) Take 1 Capsules daily or as directed by the physician.',NULL,'The recommended dosage is one capsules per day. Use daily for optimal results.','Keep out of reach of children. Do not take this or any other supplement if under the age of 18, pregnant or nursing a baby, or if you have any known or suspected medical conditions, and/or taking prescription drugs or over the counter medications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(26,'Diabetes Care','diabetes-care','Nutra\'s Bounty diabetes care is an enhanced herbal formula designed to balance blood sugar levels naturally. Made with 7 powerful Ayurvedic ingredients like Bitter Melon, Gymnema Sylvestre, and Cinnamon, it supports glucose metabolism, reduces sugar cravings, and promotes overall metabolic health. Experience superior blood sugar management with Nutra\'s Bounty.','Experience the power of nature with Nutra\'s Bounty diabetes care supplement. Our carefully selected blend of herbs works synergistically to promote blood sugar balance, promotes insulin sensitivity, and aids in overall well-being.',9,'FF755136',899.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,1,0,'2025-11-19 11:25:25','2025-11-28 07:53:25','simple',599.98,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Help maintain healthy blood sugar levels and reduce the risk of spikes and crashes.\r\nImprove your body’s response to insulin, promoting better glucose uptake by cells\r\nSupport the healthy func