 protect against environmental damage. Key ingredients like glutathione and vitamin C work to nourish the skin and enhance its overall appearance',6,'A839DAC8',600.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,1,0,'2025-11-19 11:30:25','2025-11-27 07:55:06','simple',599,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Promotes Vitality & Physical Strength\r\nBoost mood, focus, and overall sense of well-being.\r\nStress Resilience Support.\r\nEnhance Stamina & Endurance.\r\nNatural Testosterone Support.\r\nHelps in weight management.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(28,'Female Vitality','female-vitality','Experience a balanced and harmonious life with our all-natural supplement designed to support women\'s overall health. Our unique blend of botanicals helps regulate boost energy levels, enhance your mood, immune function, and promote overall well-being.','Experience renewed energy, enhanced mood, and optimal hormonal balance with our comprehensive female vitality supplement. Our carefully curated formula combines powerful antioxidants, essential vitamins, and minerals to support overall well-being and radiant health.',8,'362D56C6',1199.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,0,0,'2025-11-19 11:33:14','2025-11-28 07:55:05','simple',840,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Supports Energy & Mood.\r\nBoosts Immunity.\r\nNatural Energy Supplement.\r\nReduce Stress & Anxiety.\r\nEnhance Stamina & Endurance: Boost mood, focus, and overall sense of well-being.',NULL,'Suggested Use: (Adults) A healthy Adult can take one tablet twice a day with water or as advised by the physician or as advised by a physician or a healthcare professional.','Vegan Friendly,\r\nScientifically Tested,\r\nNo Harsh Chemicals,\r\nNON GMO,\r\nGluten Free,\r\nVegetarian,\r\nSoy Free','A healthy Adult can take one tablet twice a day with water or as advised by a physician or a healthcare professional.','Keep out of reach of children. Do not take this or any other supplement if under the age of 18, pregnant or nursing a baby, or if you have any known or 