 children. Do not take this or any other supplement if under the age of 18, pregnant or nursing a baby, or if you have any known or suspected medical conditions, and/or taking prescription drugs or over the counter medications.','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-min.png','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/5-min-1-1.jpg','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/3-min-1-1.jpg','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-min-1-1.jpg','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/5-min.png'),(31,'Marine Collagen','marine-collagen','Collagen is the body\'s most abundant protein, as it helps to structure your skin, hair, and nails. According to your age, the capacity of your body to produce collagen decreases, resulting in visible ageing signs.','Collagen is the body\'s most abundant protein, as it helps to structure your skin, hair, and nails. According to your age, the capacity of your body to produce collagen decreases, resulting in visible ',5,'45118B25',1999.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,0,0,'2025-11-19 11:41:56','2025-11-27 08:10:58','simple',649,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Reduces hair loss with thicker, stronger hair.\r\nPromotes resilient skin and hair.\r\nImproves nail brittleness and strength.\r\nProvides luxuriously tight skin with fewer fine lines, wrinkles, and stretch marks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(32,'Migraine Care','migraine-care','Migraine care involves a combination of lifestyle adjustments, symptom-based treatments, and preventative measures to reduce attack frequency and severity. Key strategies include maintaining a consistent sleep and eating schedule, managing stress through relaxation techniques, staying hydrated, and identifying and avoiding personal triggers through a headache diary','Migraine care involves a combination of lifestyle adjustments, symptom-based treatments, and preventative measures to reduce attack frequency and severity. Key strategies include ma