ture\'s remedy to the modern life\' s stress. It is also known as \"Rasayana herb\" due to its tremendous curative potential. This botanical enhances the body\'s response to stress while improving cognitive health and overall well-being.  ',8,'328B2B38',899.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,0,0,'2025-11-19 11:51:10','2025-11-28 08:02:22','simple',647,'','#FFFFFF',1,0,0,NULL,1,'Knocked off stress levels: Clinically proven to lower cortisol levels.\r\nEnhanced cognitive function: Due to its adaptogenic properties, it supports better mental clarity and focus.\r\nImproved sleep quality: Promotes deeper, more restful sleep.\r\nBetter muscle recovery: Aids in faster recovery post-exercise.\r\nStress & anxiety relief: Helps alleviate stress and anxiety.\r\nIncreased stamina & energy: Boosts overall energy levels and vitality.',NULL,'Suggested Use: (Adults) Take one or two capsule daily with water or as directed by health professionals.','Vegan Friendly,\r\nScientifically Tested,\r\nNo harsh chemicals,\r\nNon GMO,\r\nSoy-Free,\r\nGluten Free,\r\nVegetarian ','The recommended dosage is one or two capsule or as directed by health professionals. Use daily for optimal results.','Keep out of reach of children. Do not take this or any other supplement if under the age of 18, pregnant or nursing a baby, or if you have any known or suspected medical conditions, and/or taking prescription drugs or over the counter medications.','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-1.png','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-2.png','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-3.png','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-4.png','https://rasayanabio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-5.png'),(35,'test','test','asdfg','asdfg',6,'6D659C7F',500.00,'INR',100,1,NULL,1,0,0,'2025-12-18 01:44:01','2025-12-18 01:44:01','simple',500,'','#000000',1,0,0,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
